WEBVTT

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:02.760
and inspiring others to execute it.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.718
But what do we mean by innovation?

00:01:04.718 --> 00:01:08.079
An innovation is anything
that is both new and useful.

00:01:08.079 --> 00:01:09.840
It can be a product or service.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.519
It can be a process
or a way of organizing.

00:01:12.519 --> 00:01:15.359
It can be incremental,
or it can be breakthrough.

00:01:15.359 --> 00:01:17.280
We have a pretty inclusive definition.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.879
How many of you recognize this man?

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:22.560
Put your hands up.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:25.840
Keep your hands up,
if you know who this is.